   100	
   101	[`work/search_cyclic.py`](work/search_cyclic.py) searches for one resolved KTS on `Z_(v−2)∪{∞₁,∞₂}` containing one representative of every translation orbit of triples. These orbits all have length v−2, so its translates would be a complete LKTS. Exact-cover columns enforce pairs, translation orbits, and `(class,point)` incidences. Translation fixes `{0,∞₁,∞₂}`; labelling classes by the infinity-1 block's unsigned difference removes class-permutation symmetry **without further restricting the cyclic model**.
